# Production build config. Tracked in git on purpose: no secrets here, and CI
# needs it to produce the production bundle.
#
# Deliberately carries NO brand and NO absolute URL. One bundle serves every
# brand, so a baked-in name or host is wrong for all but one of them --
# VITE_API_URL used to hardcode one brand's domain, which sent every other
# brand's API calls there. The widget calls its own origin instead, and every
# brand-visible value arrives at runtime from GET /embed/context.
